H.; Kennedy, Matthew E.; Chen, Xia; Kuvelkar, Reshma; Hodgson, Robert;
Hyde, Lynn A.; Cox, Kathleen; Favreau, Leonard; Parker, Eric M.;
Greenlee, William J.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM ACS Medicinal Chemistry Letters (2012), 3(11), 897-902

