$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
4-Amino-5-phenyl-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (6a).
An argon purged mixture of 7-iodotubercidin 7 (200 mg, 0.51 mmol),
phenylboronic acid (93 mg, 0.76 mmol), Na2CO3 (502 mg, 4.74 mmol),
Pd(OAc)2 (6.6 mg, 0.029 mmol), and TPPTS (42 mg, 0.07 mmol) in water/MeCN
(2:1, 3.6 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 1 h. After cooling, the mixture
was neutralized by the addition of aqueous HCl (1M), volatiles were
removed in vacuo and the residue was purified by reverse phase
chromatography (0→100% MeOH in water).
4-Amino-5-(1H-pyrrol-3-yl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine
(6l). Compound 6l was prepared as described for 6a from compound 7 and
1-(triisopropylsilyl)-1H-pyrrole-3-boronic acid; reaction time 18 h;
after reverse phase chromatography the compound was re-purified by column
chromatography on silica (6% MeOH in CHCl3); yield 63%; white solid after
recrystallization from EtOH. mp 188-190 °C; [α]D -59.8 (c 0.276, DMSO).
UV (MeOH): λmax (ε) 284 (9700). 1H NMR (500.0 MHz, DMSO-d6): 3.52 (ddd,
1H, Jgem = 12.0, J5'b,OH = 6.3, J5'b,4' = 3.8, H-5'b); 3.61 (dd, 1H, Jgem
= 12.0, J5'a,OH = 4.9, J5'a,4' = 3.8, H-5'a); 3.88 (td, 1H, J4',5' = 3.8,
J4',3' = 3.0, H-4'); 4.08 (ddd, 1H, J3',2' = 5.1, J3',OH = 4.7, J3',4' =
3.0, H-3'); 4.43 (ddd, 1H, J2',OH = 6.5, J2',1' = 6.4, J2',3' = 5.1,
H-2'); 5.11 (d, 1H, JOH,3' = 4.7, OH-3'); 5.24 (dd, 1H, JOH,5' = 6.3,
4.9, OH-5'); 5.30 (d, 1H, JOH,2' = 6.5, OH-5'); 6.06 (d, 1H, J1',2' =
6.4, H-1'); 6.18 (td, 1H, J4,5 = J4,NH = 2.6, J4,2 = 1.6, H-4-pyrr); 6.26
(bs, 2H, NH2); 6.88 (dt, 1H, J2,NH = 2.6, J2,4 = J2,5 = 1.6, H-2-pyrr);
6.90 (td, 1H, J5,4 = J5,NH = 2.6, J5,2 = 1.6, H-5-pyrr); 7.27 (s, 1H,
H-6); 8.08 (s, 1H, H-2); 11.03 (bs, 1H, NH-pyrr). 13C NMR (125.7 MHz,
DMSO-d6): 62.00 (CH2-5'); 70.94 (CH-3'); 73.89 (CH-2'); 85.23 (CH-4');
87.12 (CH-1'); 101.65 (C-4a); 108.29 (CH-4-pyrr); 111.17 (C-5); 115.87
(C-3-pyrr); 116.44 (CH-2-pyrr); 119.33 (CH-2-pyrr); 119.65 (CH-6); 150.42
(C-7a); 151.62 (CH-2); 157.77 (C-4). MS (ESI) m/z 332 (M+H), 354 (M+Na).
HRMS (ESI) for C15H18N5O4 [M+H] calcd: 332.1353; found: 332.1354. Anal.
Calcd for (C15H17N5O4·0.8H2O): C, 52.11; H, 5.42; N, 20.26. Found: C,
52.32; H, 5.32; N, 20.03.
