$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 5. Synthesis of pyrazoles 7a-h (Scheme 4)
4-(3-(4-Fluorophenyl)-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-1H-pyrazol-5-yl)pyridine (7e):
62% yield, white solid,. Mp:127-129°C. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ. 3.88
(s, 3H), 6.92-6.97 (m, 3H), 7.15-7.20 (m, 4H), 7.29-7.32 (m, 2H),
7.88-7.93 (m, 2H), 8.60 (s, 1H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ. 55.7,
105.3, 114.6, 115.7 (d, J = 21.3 Hz), 122.7, 126.9, 127.6 (d, J = 8.1
Hz), 132.8, 138.0, 141.7, 149.9, 151.3, 159.6, 163.0 (d, J = 288.6 Hz).
HRMS (ESl): MH+, 356.1356; calcd. for C21H17FN3O : 346.1363.
