$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step h. To a mixture of Pd(PPh3)4 (4.97 g, 4.30 mmol),
2,4-dichloropyrimidine (25, 14.9 g, 100 mmol), potassium carbonate (29.7
g, 215 mmol), and 2-fluoro-3-pyridineboronic acid (16.9 g, 120 mmol) was
added dioxane (200 mL) and water (65 mL). The reaction mixture was
degassed and heated to 90 °C for 3 d, cooled to 23 °C and diluted with
EtOAc. The organic phase was washed with brine (1 x), dried over MgSO4,
and purified by flash column chromatography on silica gel (10% to 50%
EtOAc in hexanes). 2-chloro-4-(2-fluoropyridin-3-yl)pyrimidine (12.5 g,
60%) as an off white solid. MS (ESI pos. ion) m/z: 209.9 (M+ + H); 1H NMR
(400 MHz, CDCl3) δ ppm 8.71 -8.80 (m, 2 H), 8.38 (d, J = 4.7 Hz, 1 H),
7.91 (dd, J = 5.1, 1.2 Hz, 1 H), 7.42 (ddd, J = 7.3, 5.0, 1.8 Hz, 1 H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective, Suzuki coupling
