$DATUM (S)-tert-butyl
2-(6-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-benzo[
d]imidazol-2-yl)pyrrolidine-1-carboxylate (14): A mixture of
2-(6-bromo-1H-benzoimidazol-2-yl)-pyrrolidine-1-carboxylic acid
tert-butyl ester (890 mg, 2.43 mmol), bis(pinacolato)diboron (1.36g, 5.35
mmol), [1,1'-bis(diphenylphosphino)ferrocene]dichloropalladium(II) (99
mg, 0.12 mmol) and potassium acetate (620 mg, 6.32 mmol) in dioxane (15
mL) was heated to 95°C for 4 hours. The reaction mixture was cooled,
dissolved in ethyl acetate and washed with saturated sodium bicarbonate
solution. The organic layer was dried (MgSO4), filtered, concentrated and
purified by silica gel chromatography (20-80% EtOAc/hexane).
(S)-tert-butyl
2-(6-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-benzo[d]imidazol-2-yl)pyrrolidine-1-carboxylate
(14, 588 mg, 59% yield). LCMS-ESI+ m/z: [M + H]+ calc’d for C22H33BN3O4:
414.3; Found: 414.0.
