$DATUM 5-{5,15-(3,5-Di-tert-butylphenyl)-10-phenylporphyrin-20-yl}-10,20-bis(triisopropylsilylethynyl)porphyrin
bisNi(II) (9a) A Schlenk tube containing 8a (8.08 mg, 10.0 μmol), 15
(10.4 mg, 11.0 μmol), Pd2(dba)3·CHCl3 (1.3 mg, 1.3 μmol), PPh3 (2.0 mg,
7.6 μmol), and Cs2CO3 (21.6 mg, 66 μmol) was evacuated and then refilled
with N2. To the tube, degassed toluene (1 mL), degassed DMF (0.2 mL), and
water (1 drop) were added. After the mixture was stirred for 3 h at 100
ºC, the solvent was evaporated in vacuo. The product was purified by
column chromatography on silica-gel (CHCl3/hexane as an eluent) and
recrystallization from CHCl3/MeOH. 9a (11.78 mg, 7.62 μmol) in 58% yield.
1H NMR (CDCl3): δ 9.87 (s, 1H, meso), 9.68 (d, J = 5.0 Hz, 2H, β), 9.36
(d, J = 5.0 Hz, 2H), 9.19 (d, J = 5.0 Hz, 2H, β), 8.84 (s, 4H, β), 8.61
(d, J = 5.0 Hz, 2H, β), 8.12-8.14 (m, 4H, Ph, β), 7.99 (d, J = 5.0 Hz,
2H, β), 7.90 (d, J = 2.0 Hz, 4H, Ar-o), 7.73-7.74 (m, 3H, Ph), 7.67 (t, J
= 2.0 Hz, 2H, Ar-p), 1.42 (s, 36H, t-Bu), 1.31 (m, 42H, TIPS) ppm; 13C
NMR (CDCl3): δ 149.0, 146.9, 146.8, 145.9, 145.3, 143.7, 143.1, 142.8,
142.7, 141.3, 140.0, 134.8, 133.8, 133.1, 132.6, 132.3, 132.1, 131.9,
129.0, 127.0, 121.4, 120.0, 118.1, 115.0, 106.0, 101.4, 99.8, 35.1, 31.8,
19.1, 11.8 ppm; HR-MS (APCI-MS): m/z = 1545.6902, calcd for
(C96H107N8Ni2Si2)+ = 1545.6861 [(M + H)+].
