$DATUM (S)-2'-(2,4-difluoropyridin-3-yl)-7'-(neopentyloxy)-5H-spiro[oxazole-4,9'-xanthen]-2-amine
(32). To a solution of
(S)-2'-(neopentyloxy)-7'-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-5H-spiro[oxazole-4,9'-xanthen]-2-amine
(23) (150 mg, 0.323 mmol) in BuOH (2.5 mL), 2,4-difluoro-3-iodopyridine
(93mg, 0.388 mmol), and KOAc (95 mg, 0.969 mmol) in water (0.65 mL) in a
sealed tube was added Pd(Amphos)Cl2 (4.57 mg, 6.46 μmol) and the reaction
mixture was sealed and heated at 90°C. After 20 h, the reaction was
cooled to rt, diluted with MeOH (3ml), loaded onto SCX cartridge, washed
with MeOH and eluted with 2N NH3 in MeOH to give the crude product.
Solvent was removed and the crude material was brought up in MeOH (2ml)
and purified by reverse-phase preparative HPLC (0.1% TFA in CH3CN/H2O,
gradient 10% to 90%).
(S)-2'-(2,4-difluoropyridin-3-yl)-7'-(neopentyloxy)-5H-spiro[oxazole-4,9'-xanthen]-2-amine
(32) (35.4mg, 0.064 mmol, 53.3% yield) as a TFA salt. 1H NMR (300 MHz,
CD3CN) δ ppm 8.22 (t, J=7.0 Hz, 1 H), 7.70 (s, 1 H), 7.60 (d, J=8.2 Hz, 1
H), 7.32 (d, J=9.1 Hz, 1 H), 7.16 -7.28 (m, 2 H), 7.03 -7.11 (m, 2 H),
4.84 -5.00 (m, 2 H), 3.69 (s, 2 H), 1.05 (s, 9 H). Signals of protonated
amino group were not observed due to broadening. MS m/z = 452.0 [M+H]+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki coupling reaction, sealed tube used
