$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step b (preparation of 23h): To a solution of
8-fluoro-2-methyl-6-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)imidazo[1,2-a]pyridine
(5.18 g, 18.8 mmol) in acetonitrile (160 mL) were added Pd(Ph3P)4 (1.08
g, 0.94 mmol), 2-chloro-7-fluoropyrido[1,2-a]pyrimidin-4-one 22 (4.47 g,
22.5 mmol), and an aqueous solution of K2CO3 (18.8 mL, 2 M, 37.6 mmol).
The reaction mixture was heated at 80 °C for 5 h and concentrated in
vacuo. Purification of the residue by column chromatography (SiO2,
CH2Cl2/MeOH, 98:2 to 95:5) gave
7-fluoro-2-(8-fluoro-2-methylimidazo[1,2-a]pyridin-6-yl)pyrido[1,2-a]-pyrimidin-4-one
(23h) (3.59 g, 51%) as a light yellow solid.
